        Quest("CH2-016",2,16,"An Assignment from the Ring of Water",category="Vatras",giver = "Vatras",location="Vatras",prerequisites="Reach Chapter 2 and speak with Vatras.",summary="Track an injured white shadowbeast from the Dead Harpy tavern toward the Water Mages' excavation.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Talk to Vatras about work for the Ring of Water in Chapter 2.","Visit Orlan at the Dead Harpy tavern; he describes a violent animal attack under the nearby bridge.","Search under the bridge for a torn strip of hide, then return to Orlan.","Ask Bosper or Falk to identify the hide; it belongs to a rare white shadowbeast.","Follow the white fur tufts by the Innos shrine on the monastery path and onward toward the Water Mages' excavation.","Defeat the wounded white shadowbeast, then report first to Orlan and afterwards to Vatras."),reward="Reward varies by quest/build; exact values should be taken from the current in-game dialogue or source page.",warnings="Follow the quest sequence before attempting to complete this objective. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/poruchenie-kolca-vody.66765/",searchTags=listOf("an assignment from the ring of water","vatras","local quest giver in vatras")),
